    "detailed_description": "Inversion Institute is a visual novel/puzzle game set in a medieval fantasy world.  Using Master Leo's recent invention, Magic Ink, you will draw working logical gizmos and contraptions to solve problems for the Institute and surrounding townsfolk. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145480/extras/9d01033c9e7d0750b5906f712b2e9ab7.avif?t=1666457489\" /></div><br><br>With the help of other characters, you may even invent a machine that will change the world forever.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145480/extras/688841cd2b2eee1d8f7deacd805e92b7.avif?t=1666457489\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>easy, intuitive, and compact &quot;pixel logic&quot; circuit simulator<br></li><li>puzzles motivated by engaging visual novel<br></li><li>multiple characters to meet and locations to visit<br></li><li>runs on Windows, Mac, and Linux</li></ul>",
